{"id":"33062875-2253-4637-9dae-37ef576d8dde","recipient":"742d8843-c960-4768-90c7-ffe65462bd85","sender":"1ff024d7-69dc-4336-8bad-8a8cb7162983","priority":"MESSAGE_PRIORITY_HIGH","timestamp":"2026-11-15T08:57:58.648626Z","renderDetails":{"messageTitle":"Message from Browser Performance Inspector (browser)"},"content":"The connection to Chrome could not be established (Chrome DevTools MCP server is unavailable / DevToolsActivePort file was not found).\n\nPlease enable remote debugging in Google Chrome to allow browser automation:\n1. Ensure Google Chrome is running with remote debugging enabled. You can check settings by navigating to `chrome://inspect/#remote-debugging`.\n2. Check the `DevToolsActivePort` file of your default Chrome profile (`~/Library/Application Support/Google/Chrome/DevToolsActivePort`).\n3. Check that the remote debugging port is open.\n4. Verify if there are multiple processes listening on the port, and if so, terminate conflicting processes.\n\nNote: The session recording is available in the conversation artifacts.","sourceMetadata":{"tool":{"conversationId":"1ff024d7-69dc-4336-8bad-8a8cb7162983","stepIndex":4,"toolCall":{"id":"call_6203429860866074121","name":"send_message","argumentsJson":"{\"Message\":\"The connection to Chrome could not be established (Chrome DevTools MCP server is unavailable / DevToolsActivePort file was not found).\\n\\nPlease enable remote debugging in Google Chrome to allow browser automation:\\n1. Ensure Google Chrome is running with remote debugging enabled. You can check settings by navigating to `chrome://inspect/#remote-debugging`.\\n2. Check the `DevToolsActivePort` file of your default Chrome profile (`~/Library/Application Support/Google/Chrome/DevToolsActivePort`).\\n3. Check that the remote debugging port is open.\\n4. Verify if there are multiple processes listening on the port, and if so, terminate conflicting processes.\\n\\nNote: The session recording is available in the conversation artifacts.\",\"Recipient\":\"742d8843-c960-4768-90c7-ffe65462bd85\"}","thinkingSignature":""}}}}